WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:03,610
When you were asleep, I added the loyalty status to Yanguang without permission

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:07,010
He has no memory and is a high-level energy user. It would be too risky to leave him alone.

3
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:10,810
It's okay this time. Before you enforce the rules on others in the future, please tell me first.

4
00:00:10,810 --> 00:00:15,210
Understand, I will let him work in the back and maintenance area, and slowly pay off the debt for the broken door

5
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:29,191
Mud tires can become selection targets

6
00:00:29,191 --> 00:00:37,580
Lasts about three hours

7
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:40,380
After my resurrection, I won’t be able to bring you here with my own abilities.

8
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:43,580
The only thing this body can use is its original clay body.
